the target language is: prolog.

the templates are:
    Härtefallleistung holds for *a case*.
    Härtefall liegt vor holds for *a case*.
    Pflegegrad mindestens 3 holds for *a case*; open textured.
    Eigenanteil über 800 eur holds for *a case*; open textured.
    Alleinlebend holds for *a case*; open textured.
    child *a number* of Härtefall liegt vor counts for *a case*.
    Härtefall liegt vor is decided for *a case*.
    Härtefall liegt vor would hold for *a case*; unknown.
    Pflegegrad mindestens 3 is decided for *a case*; scenario element.
    Eigenanteil über 800 eur is decided for *a case*; scenario element.
    Alleinlebend is decided for *a case*; scenario element.

the knowledge base r4_14_hardship_with_text_and_action includes:

the text of the_rulemap is at "sources/hardship-with-text-and-action.ruml".

sgb xii 90 is published at "https://www.gesetze-im-internet.de/sgb_12/__90.html".

Härtefallleistung holds for a case if
    Härtefall liegt vor holds for the case.

child 1 of Härtefall liegt vor counts for a case if
    Pflegegrad mindestens 3 holds for the case.

child 2 of Härtefall liegt vor counts for a case if
    Eigenanteil über 800 eur holds for the case.

child 3 of Härtefall liegt vor counts for a case if
    Alleinlebend holds for the case.

% Mindestens zwei der drei Härtefallmerkmale müssen vorliegen
rule node_2 with provenance sgb xii 90:
Härtefall liegt vor holds for a case if
    Härtefall liegt vor is decided for the case
    and a number M is the count of each N such that
        child a number N of Härtefall liegt vor counts for the case
    and M >= 2.

Härtefall liegt vor holds for a case if
    it is not the case that Härtefall liegt vor is decided for the case
    and Härtefall liegt vor would hold for the case.

Härtefall liegt vor is decided for a case if
    Pflegegrad mindestens 3 is decided for the case
    and Eigenanteil über 800 eur is decided for the case
    and Alleinlebend is decided for the case.

scenario generated_1 is, as stated in "hardship-with-text-and-action.ruml" at generated_1:
    % no data
    node_1 expects answers ["Härtefallleistung holds for case 1"] and any unknowns.
    not_node_1 expects answers ["it is not the case that Härtefallleistung holds for case 1"] and any unknowns.
    node_2 expects answers ["Härtefall liegt vor holds for case 1"] and any unknowns.
    not_node_2 expects answers ["it is not the case that Härtefall liegt vor holds for case 1"] and any unknowns.
    node_4 expects answers ["Pflegegrad mindestens 3 holds for case 1"] and any unknowns.
    not_node_4 expects answers ["it is not the case that Pflegegrad mindestens 3 holds for case 1"] and any unknowns.
    node_5 expects answers ["Eigenanteil über 800 eur holds for case 1"] and any unknowns.
    not_node_5 expects answers ["it is not the case that Eigenanteil über 800 eur holds for case 1"] and any unknowns.
    node_6 expects answers ["Alleinlebend holds for case 1"] and any unknowns.
    not_node_6 expects answers ["it is not the case that Alleinlebend holds for case 1"] and any unknowns.

query node_1 is:
    Härtefallleistung holds for case 1.

query not_node_1 is:
    it is not the case that Härtefallleistung holds for case 1.

query node_2 is:
    Härtefall liegt vor holds for case 1.

query not_node_2 is:
    it is not the case that Härtefall liegt vor holds for case 1.

query node_4 is:
    Pflegegrad mindestens 3 holds for case 1.

query not_node_4 is:
    it is not the case that Pflegegrad mindestens 3 holds for case 1.

query node_5 is:
    Eigenanteil über 800 eur holds for case 1.

query not_node_5 is:
    it is not the case that Eigenanteil über 800 eur holds for case 1.

query node_6 is:
    Alleinlebend holds for case 1.

query not_node_6 is:
    it is not the case that Alleinlebend holds for case 1.

